  "notes": "Geometric for «حزب الله». 57-58 (the mockers) under a night sky with no motif; nothing illustrates the mockery or the call to prayer. STAGING v4: 56 stays ambient (allegiance to Allah and His Messenger, the party of Allah). 57-58: a prayer hall; believers on one side, three men (the mockers) on the other. The mockers talk and point at the believers on 57:9-10 (taking the religion in jest); a book plate for those given the Book (57:14); nothing is acted on the prohibition or on the condition of 57:19-23. 58:1 one man (the caller, Al-Muyassar) enters and calls on 58:2; the believers stand in prayer on 58:4; the mockers talk and point at the caller on 58:5-6. No Kaaba, no minaret. The cover moves to 58:7 (the mockers and the prayer) to match its title."
